# Random OTP Generator

## Project Name
Random OTP Generator

## Problem Statement
Create a simple Java console-based OTP Generator that generates
a random 6-digit OTP and displays it to the user.

## Technologies Used
- Java
- java.util.Random
- Git
- GitHub

## How to Run the Program
1. Open OTPGenerator.java in a Java IDE.
2. Compile the program.
3. Run the program.
4. The program displays a random 6-digit OTP.

## Sample Output
========== OTP GENERATOR ==========
Your OTP is: 583214
===================================

The OTP will be different each time the program runs.
